@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-local-access-token
@businessId = 1
@batchId = 1

### Download CSV v1 template
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/opening-imports/template?importType=Employee&templateVersion=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Business-Id: {{businessId}}

### Private upload requires approved ADR-03 composition; otherwise 503
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/opening-imports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Business-Id: {{businessId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=OpeningImport

--OpeningImport
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ImportType"

Employee
--OpeningImport
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="TemplateVersion"

1
--OpeningImport
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="IdempotencyKey"

opening-example-employee-v1
--OpeningImport
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="opening.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

ExternalKey,EmployeeCode,FirstName,DisplayName,EmploymentTypeId,EmploymentStatus,JoiningDate,PositionId,OrgUnitId,LocationProjectionId,AssignmentType,NationalId,Mobile
opening-001,EMP-OPEN-001,Alex,Alex Employee,11,Active,2026-10-01,,,,,,
--OpeningImport--

### Mandatory dry-run (no employees, periods or assignments)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/opening-imports/{{batchId}}/dry-run
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Business-Id: {{businessId}}

### Review summary and row errors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/opening-imports/{{batchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Business-Id: {{businessId}}

### Execute only after Ready; atomic and duplicate-safe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/opening-imports/{{batchId}}/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Business-Id: {{businessId}}

### Unknown Business-scoped batch returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/opening-imports/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Business-Id: {{businessId}}
